    "semanticRules": [
      "`PK(workspace_id,material_handle_id)`",
      "`UNIQUE(workspace_id,relative_path)`",
      "`rowMutability=cas_lifecycle`且只允许幂等filesystem cleanup effect以expected Handle fence执行一次`active→reclaimed`，三个reclaimed列在active时全NULL、terminal时全非NULL且write-once",
      "`handle_schema_ref=WorkspaceMaterialHandle@1`、canonical JSON≤`4 KiB`、`handle_digest=SHA-256(JCS(handle_json typed value))`，全部热列与Handle逐字段一致，`fence_digest=handle_json.fenceDigest`",
      "同一inode的hard-link location允许共享materialKey但必须是不同Handle/relative path",
      "endpoint/mount/root handle必须等于Workspace Registry/root snapshot",
      "完整Physical Identity由Workspace write effect在同一Effect commit按实际文件stat与中段最多256 KiB fingerprint形成，系统生成Artifact的完整digest只允许从原写入流形成且不参与`material_key`",
      "路径必须通过containment validator",
      "只有bytes关闭、fingerprint/stat/containment及独立Artifact digest完成且完整Handle row与Effect receipt同事务durable后Executor才能返回该Handle。Domain Cleanup Commit只读取该terminal row/Evidence并收口Libra Reference/Control，不再次删除bytes或改写本row"
    ],
    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`workspace_id FK, material_handle_id, material_key, endpoint_id, mount_scope_id, inode, fingerprint_algorithm, fingerprint_version, content_fingerprint, relative_path, digest_algorithm, digest_hex, size_bytes, reference_revision, owner_domain, process_id, root_handle_ref, access_scope, handle_schema_ref, handle_json, handle_digest, fence_digest, state(active|reclaimed), reclaimed_effect_id NULL, reclaimed_effect_receipt_digest NULL, reclaimed_at_ms NULL`",
      "constraints": "`PK(workspace_id,material_handle_id)`；`UNIQUE(workspace_id,relative_path)`；`rowMutability=cas_lifecycle`且只允许幂等filesystem cleanup effect以expected Handle fence执行一次`active→reclaimed`，三个reclaimed列在active时全NULL、terminal时全非NULL且write-once；`handle_schema_ref=WorkspaceMaterialHandle@1`、canonical JSON≤`4 KiB`、`handle_digest=SHA-256(JCS(handle_json typed value))`，全部热列与Handle逐字段一致，`fence_digest=handle_json.fenceDigest`；同一inode的hard-link location允许共享materialKey但必须是不同Handle/relative path；endpoint/mount/root handle必须等于Workspace Registry/root snapshot；完整Physical Identity由Workspace write effect在同一Effect commit按实际文件stat与中段最多256 KiB fingerprint形成，系统生成Artifact的完整digest只允许从原写入流形成且不参与`material_key`；路径必须通过containment validator；只有bytes关闭、fingerprint/stat/containment及独立Artifact digest完成且完整Handle row与Effect receipt同事务durable后Executor才能返回该Handle。Domain Cleanup Commit只读取该terminal row/Evidence并收口Libra Reference/Control，不再次删除bytes或改写本row"
    },
